      "name": "Fire and pre-fire biomass in the Beni savanna–forest mosaic: a replication of Staver, Archibald & Levin (2011) on WGS84 HEALPix",
      "description": "Replication of Staver, Archibald & Levin (2011, Science): at intermediate rainfall, only fire separates savanna from forest. ESA CCI Biomass v7.0 (2023), ESA Fire_cci SYN v1.1 (2024) and CHELSA bio12 are joined on HEALPix depth 11 (WGS84) with healpix-connector for the Beni savanna–forest mosaic, Bolivia (10,344 cells). The share of land burned in 2024 falls with pre-fire biomass (Spearman -0.38), also within each rainfall tercile. Outcome: partially supported. This research object aggregates the code, Zenodo release, notebooks, input datasets, source paper and (once published) the FORRT nanopublication chain.",
